-    - experiment_id: exp6915-qualified-relation-event-bank
-      verdict: complete_disqualified_qualified_relation_event_bank_thresholds_not_met
-      addressed_by: The new acquisition interface grounds two verbatim spans before relation typing, uses the Exp6926 exact fixture contract, and requires complete coverage from all three mandated SOTA families.
-      retire_if_same_verdict: true
