-       model_family_metric_rows; byte_offset_recheck_rows; alias_recheck_rows;
-       direction_recheck_rows; hidden_reference_rows_hash; label_isolation_rows;
-       aggregate_recompute_rows; missing_row_rows; disqualification_rows; random_seed;
-       reproducibility_checksum; qualified_relation_bank_score; gate_check_summary with the failed
-       check, expected value, and observed value for any blocked verdict;
-       verifier_is_oracle (false); verdict_class (positive | circular_positive | null | blocked |
-       disqualified | partial); honest_verdict (terminal and prefixed complete_ or blocked_).
